# Ark Angels 5: the exit. qm2 outside a battlefield: the handler returns nil and qm2 is LaLoff's DefaultActions
# NO_RESPONSE_CANNOT_ESCAPE. Inside, qm2 plays 32003 (0, 0, 0, 0, 4, 180); option 0 stays, option 4 leaves.
lists LaloffAmphitheater/qm1_5/onTrigger LaloffAmphitheater/onEventUpdate/32000 LaloffAmphitheater/onEventFinish/32000 LaloffAmphitheater/onEventFinish/32001 LaloffAmphitheater/onEventFinish/32002 LaloffAmphitheater/qm2/onTrigger LaloffAmphitheater/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=LaloffAmphitheater pos=557.498,-38.205,520.627 job=WAR lvl=99 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ArkAngels current
login
missionstatus Zilart 1                  # a GM
trigger qm2                             # in no battlefield: nil: NO_RESPONSE_CANNOT_ESCAPE
finish-if-event
warp 557.498,-38.205,520.627 LaloffAmphitheater
trigger qm1_5
update 32000 option=65
finish
tick 2000
trigger qm2                             # 32003
finish option=0                         # stays
trigger qm2                             # 32003
finish option=4                         # out
tick 2000
